 *
 * 1. Create a new admin role assignment using the appropriate API (store id, created_at).
 * 2. Retrieve the admin assignment by id via the get-by-id API as an authorized admin user.
 * 3. Assert that the returned data matches the original assignment (id, created_at exactly).
 * 4. Confirm no unexpected fields are present in the API response.
 */
