 * 2. Create a sample post to be reported (for test isolation, done as a member,
 *    since only members create posts).
 * 3. File a content report as the guest for the target post.
 * 4. Simulate moderation on the report (status update or note addition) via
 *    moderator endpoint.
 * 5. Attempt to delete the same report as the guest; expect an error as deletion
 *    should now be forbidden by business rules.
 */
export async function test_api_contentReports_test_delete_guest_content_report_after_moderation_forbidden(
