 *
 *    - Expect a not found error.
 * 5. Negative Test: Attempt to retrieve using an invalid UUID format.
 *
 *    - Expect validation error or appropriate failure. (Optional, not directly
 *         possible with provided SDK) 6. If able, verify access is forbidden
 *         when requesting with insufficient permissions (if the endpoint
