 * 4. (SKIPPED) Attempt to update the moderation action with an extra, undocumented
 *    property—not possible in TypeScript; cannot compile.
 * 5. (SKIPPED) Attempt to update the moderation action by including a forbidden
 *    schema property (e.g., id)—not possible in TypeScript; cannot compile.
 * 6. Confirm the moderation action state is updated as expected.
 */
