 * Confirms that the admin post edit log list endpoint supports real-world use
 * cases with schema-based filters, pagination, and sortability. Validates both
 * positive scenarios (with results) and edge/error handling scenarios (overly
 * restrictive filter, empty filter).
 *
 * Steps:
 *
 * 1. Create a member post so edit logs can be generated using the dependency
 *    endpoint.
 * 2. Assume that an edit to the post is made and an edit log exists (edit
