 *    and expect empty result.
 * 6. (Sorting can't be directly tested as the DTO/request doesn’t support a sort
 *    parameter—note this edge case).
 * 7. Again, retrieve with minimal/empty filter and default pagination parameters
 *    to check retrieval of all logs admin is entitled to view.
 */
export async function test_api_prefix_admin_threadsPosts_postEditLogs_test_list_post_edit_logs_with_complex_filter_sort_and_pagination_admin(
